.TH CHECKERS 6 "1 September 2026"
.SH NAME
checkers \- 3D checkers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B checkers [\fIfile\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B checkers
is a fairly simple cross-platform 3D checkers implementation.
If supplied \fIfile\fR is the name of an existing save file to open on startup.
.PP
On systems with keyboard input, controls are as such:
.TP
.B Arrow keys
Move to select a piece on the board, a possible move for a given piece, or
menu item.
.TP
.B Space
Choose the selected menu item; choose a piece or move.
.TP
.B Backspace
Back out of moving a piece so you can select another.
.TP
.B Escape
Go to the main menu.
.PP
You may also use the mouse.
.PP
From the menu you can select options which should all be self-explanatory, such
as starting a new local game or a network game.
.SH AUTHORS
Written by Jeandre Kruger.
.SH BUGS
This is a pretty basic program so far.
